From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amaan Qureshi <git@amaanq.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 22:48:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] add intent action to open external URLs in private mode

External ACTION_VIEW intents land in a regular tab; IncognitoTabLauncher drops
the caller URL by design. PrivateUrlLauncher carries the URL through to a
trusted incognito re-dispatch under the same policy gate, and its component
state doubles as an incognito availability check that works before native
loads.
